---
---

<section class="hp-why" data-screen-label="04 Why LightSpeed">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hp-why-grid">
      <!-- Left column -->
      <div class="hp-why-left">
        <span class="hp-eyebrow" style="color: #7be7ff;">WHY LIGHTSPEED</span>
        <h2 class="hp-h2" style="color: #ffffff;">Most website problems are platform problems</h2>
        <p class="hp-why-lead">
          Messy content, unclear governance, brittle templates, hard-to-measure journeys and layers of technical debt. LightSpeed works across the full lifecycle to fix the right things, not just the visible ones.
        </p>
        <a href="#" class="hp-why-cta">How we work</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Right column: 2x2 grid -->
      <div class="hp-why-points">
        <div class="hp-why-point">
          <div class="hp-why-point-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <path d="M12 16v-4m0-4h.01"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="hp-h4">Platform thinking, not page thinking</h4>
          <p class="hp-why-point-body">
            We work across the full lifecycle — from content structure to design systems, engineering, launch control and long-term support.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="hp-why-point">
          <div class="hp-why-point-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="hp-h4">Less rework, more confidence</h4>
          <p class="hp-why-point-body">
            Better decisions made early mean better outcomes later. A platform your internal team can actually live with after launch.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="hp-why-point">
          <div class="hp-why-point-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <polyline points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="hp-h4">Built for maintainability</h4>
          <p class="hp-why-point-body">
            Clear governance, real documentation and a WordPress build model shaped for long-term confidence rather than short-term patchwork.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="hp-why-point">
          <div class="hp-why-point-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"></line>
              <polyline points="19 12 12 19 5 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="hp-h4">Strategy and delivery in one</h4>
          <p class="hp-why-point-body">
            We connect content, design, engineering and platform care — so the whole platform improves, not just the homepage.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hp-why {
    background: #090909;
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: clamp(64px, 9vw, 96px) 0;
  }

  .hp-why-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .hp-why-left {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .hp-why-lead {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .hp-why-cta {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
    font-size: 14px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-out);
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  .hp-why-cta:hover {
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  .hp-why-points {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .hp-why-point {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 22px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .hp-why-point-icon {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    color: #7be7ff;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .hp-why-point-icon svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .hp-why-point .hp-h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .hp-why-point-body {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .hp-why-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
    }

    .hp-why-points {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .hp-why-points {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
